      de: ["Established in 1966 and opened to visitors in 1974", "Occupies a massive territory of 195 hectares along the Kaunas Reservoir", "Features a collection of approximately 150 historic rural buildings", "Represents the 4 historical ethnographic regions of Lithuania", "Organizes over 15 major traditional folk festivals each year", "Includes a historically accurate 19th-century town center replica", "Contains over 91,000 artifacts in its complete museum collection"],
